            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo CB-100-CP, 16 Inch Surface Mounted Cane Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 16 Inch Cane Bolt can be mounted vertically or horizontally. It features a sturdy design with 2 guide plates. It is packaged with mounting screws. The Don-Jo CB-100  16 Inch Surface Mounted Cane Bolt has a satin chrome plated finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-CB-100-Specifications.gif?v=1704354623\" width=\"562\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo CB-100 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo CB 100 16 inch Door Cane Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Chrome Plated</b></li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Length: 3.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: .490\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with bolt, guides, and mounting hardware.\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-CB-100-specifications.pdf?v=1704262428\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo CB-100 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
